KNOWNBUG libcxx20
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++
^VERIFICATION
^EXIT=(0|10)$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
[temp.deduct.funcaddr] for std::endl fails on libc++-20 because
basic_ostream is forward-declared without ID_C_template metadata.
The synthetic fargs deduction path can't match the struct_tag
against the template pattern. Works on libc++-18.
